-- הסכם קיבוצי (24.1.2008) — העותק שנשלח בפקס: a second copy of the
-- agreement of 24.1.2008 that ended the 2007 post-primary strike, which the
-- corpus publishes beside the copy the agreement is encoded from
-- (`2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model`, "the primary").
-- This one is the faxed copy, with the Registrar's stamp of 15.5.2008 (no.
-- 43/2008), and the scan holds only its first fax pages: it breaks off in
-- §5(ג), and the corpus marks the rest as missing from the scan, pointing
-- to the primary for the whole. What it does hold is the primary's text,
-- row for row, save the fax banners, the stamp and a misprint in §5(ב)'s
-- table; so each row it shares is cited "as in the primary", by the rule
-- that encodes it there, and this file imports the primary.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model`
IMPORT minimum_wage_law
IMPORT vocabulary

