`what the faxed copy of 24.1.2008 lacks` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "עמודי הפקס 4–10: מסוף סעיף 5(ג) ועד סוף ההסכם (ההסכם כולו בעותק 2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model)"

-- Against the Minimum Wage Law's floor (MMS-601): §4(ה) is the primary's,
-- and so is its check — the wage supplement is left out of the pay that
-- counts toward the top-up, which makes the top-up the law's or more (its
-- §11). Checked on a month's figures as if §3 counted it (a fixed
-- supplement for the work), the strictest case.
#ASSERT NOT `counting a component as the instrument does falls below the Minimum Wage Law` 5300 4800 (`component paid in the month under the Minimum Wage Law` `a fixed supplement paid for the work, under section 3(ב)(3)` 300) (`the wage supplement counts for` `topping up to the minimum wage`)
